title: "AI Legislation Tracker: A Curated Dataset of Global AI Laws and Governance Frameworks"
type: dataset
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24618162
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24618162
    description: "DOI for all versions, archived on Zenodo. It resolves to the latest release; each release also has its own DOI."
authors:
  - family-names: Schlangen
    given-names: Del
