repository-code: "https://github.com/delschlangen/ai-legislation-tracker"
url: "https://delschlangen.github.io/ai-legislation-tracker/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A structured, machine-readable dataset tracking AI legislation, regulation
  and governance frameworks across US federal, US state and international
  jurisdictions. Each record carries a permanent id and a last_verified date,
  and may carry a verification level (primary, secondary or unconfirmed) and
  supersession links showing what replaced what. Includes CLI tools for querying and
  a browser interface.
